<title>QATAR: Qatar names a new 20-member cabinet.</title>
<headline>Qatar names a new 20-member cabinet.</headline>
<dateline>DOHA 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Qatar's Emir on Wednesday named a new 20-member cabinet. Following is a list of the government.</p>
<p> Emir (Ruler)...............Sheikh Hamad bin Khalifa al-Thani</p>
<p>(Also Minister of Defence)  Crown Prince (heir</p>
<p>apparent).........Sheikh Jassim bin Hamad</p>
<p>						     bin Khalifa al-Thani</p>
<p> Prime Minister..........Sheikh Abdullah bin Khalifa al-Thani</p>
<p>(also Minister of the Interior)  Communications,</p>
<p>Transport............Sheikh Ahmad bin Nasser al-Thani</p>
<p> Defence...............See Emir</p>
<p> Education.........Mohammad Abdel-Rahim Kafoud</p>
<p> Endowments &amp; Islamic Affairs.........Ahmad Abdullah al-Marri</p>
<p> Energy &amp; Industry..............Abdullah bin Hamad al-Attiyah</p>
<p> Finance, Economy &amp; Trade.........Sheikh Mohammad bin Khalifa</p>
<p>								     al-Thani</p>
<p> Foreign Affairs....Sheikh Hamad bin Jassim bin Jabr al-Thani</p>
<p> Health............Abdulrahman Salem al-Kawari</p>
<p>Interior....See Prime Minister</p>
<p> Justice.............Najeeb Mohammad al-Nuaimi</p>
<p> Minister of State.............Sheikh Ahmad bin Saif al-Thani</p>
<p> Minister of State...........Sheikh Hassan bin</p>
<p>					 Abdullah bin Mohammad al-Thani</p>
<p> Minister of State............Sheikh Hamad bin Sahim al-Thani</p>
<p> Minister of State.........Sheikh Hamad bin Abdullah al-Thani</p>
<p>Minister of State for Cabinet Affairs....Sheikh Mohammad bin</p>
<p>							    Khaled al-Thani</p>
<p>Minister of State for Interior Affairs...Sheikh Abdullah bin</p>
<p>							    Khaled al-Thani</p>
<p> Minister of State for Foreign Affairs.........Ahmad Abdullah</p>
<p>								   al-Mahmood</p>
<p> Municipal Affairs &amp; Agriculture........Ali Said al-Khiyareen</p>
<p>Power &amp; Water...Ahmad Mohammad Ali al-Subai'e</p>
<p> Minister of Housing and Civil Services......Sheikh Falah bin</p>
<p>							    Jassim al-Thani</p>
</text>
